{"seq":2,"slug":"web-security","title":"Web 应用安全","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/application-security/web-security","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"owasp-top-ten","title":"OWASP Top 10 深度解析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/application-security/web-security/owasp-top-ten","wordCount":3296,"readingTime":14},{"seq":2,"slug":"authentication-authorization","title":"认证与授权安全机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/application-security/web-security/authentication-authorization","wordCount":2719,"readingTime":11},{"seq":3,"slug":"client-side-security","title":"客户端安全防护","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/application-security/web-security/client-side-security","wordCount":2630,"readingTime":11}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"web-应用安全-简介\">Web 应用安全 简介</h1><p>本章系统讲解 Web 应用面临的核心安全威胁及其防御技术，帮助读者建立从漏洞识别到纵深防御的完整能力。</p>\n<p>第一节<strong>OWASP Top 10 深度解析</strong>以 2021 版和 2025 版草案为基准，逐项剖析十大 Web 应用安全风险的技术成因、利用方式和防御方案，帮助开发者理解当前最紧迫的应用层威胁。</p>\n<p>第二节<strong>认证与授权安全机制</strong>聚焦身份验证和访问控制这两个最基础也最容易出错的安全领域，讲解 OAuth 2.0、OpenID Connect、JWT、多因素认证等机制的安全设计与常见陷阱。</p>\n<p>第三节<strong>客户端安全</strong>深入探讨浏览器端的攻防技术，包括跨站脚本（XSS）、跨站请求伪造（CSRF）、内容安全策略（CSP）等客户端安全机制的原理与实践。</p>\n"}